{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha is an action-adventure game where you play as Prince Avyaan, a brave warrior and skilled archer on a cursed island plagued by evil demons. Uncover secrets of ancient masks, master bow-and-arrow combat, and face epic combat in a dark mythic kingdom of ancient power and fierce warriors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.poster.avif?t=1767086685\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.webm?t=1767086685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prince Avyaan\u2019s Path</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the unknown and confront spreading corruption consuming everything in its path.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into dark depths to battle demonic forces and reclaim your lost honor with sword and bow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.poster.avif?t=1767086685\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/c49ce90effd4466bf1f7a1cc55e66132.webm?t=1767086685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Looming Curse</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie forests, decaying temples, and hidden caverns where reality blurs into mystery. Uncover secrets of ancient relics, swords, and legends tied to a forgotten past.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face monsters, devils, and dark powers that challenge your survival in this single-player story-driven experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.webp?t=1767086685\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/fbd4e5228ea7814e541ac2c95091dcaa.poster.avif?t=1767086685\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat: </strong>Engage in dynamic combat as a fierce fighter. Use your bow and arrow or sword to strike enemies from near and far. Adapt your fighting style to survive relentless attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Unveiled: </strong>Unravel the mystery of the island through environmental storytelling, ancient murals, and cryptic notes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour &amp; Exploration: </strong>Scale cliffs and navigate treacherous terrain with parkour skills, solving puzzles to progress deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles: </strong>Test your skills against towering monsters and deadly demons standing as a testament to the curse\u2019s power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.poster.avif?t=1767086685\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/9d9d6330c57dc508c8972050644981b4.webm?t=1767086685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0Will you survive the dark trials and uphold the legacy of your people? Take up your bow, sword, and courage to\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0write your own legend in this thrilling action-adventure game.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3320200?t=1767086685","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/5d4389235c5b8a292a584e8c5f04e42fa1fb8b12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767086685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/2dd00e16908352bfe02c592f0a2e87976fa53800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767086685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/2dd00e16908352bfe02c592f0a2e87976fa53800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767086685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violence and blood."},"demos":[{"appid":3464170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaal Yoddha is an action-adventure game where you play as Prince Avyaan, a brave warrior and skilled archer on a cursed island plagued by evil demons. Uncover secrets of ancient masks, master bow-and-arrow combat, and face epic combat in a dark mythic kingdom of ancient power and fierce warriors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320200/extras/f0d29fdcf6c20688141dd3325853f9ae.poster.avif?t=1767086685\" width=616 height=250 ><source src